{"full":"hf:ajaybandiwaddar01/queue-doctor","spaceId":"ajaybandiwaddar01/queue-doctor","name":"Queue Doctor","source":"huggingface","description":"An interactive AI application on Hugging Face Spaces.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","openenv","rl","reinforcement-learning","healthcare","triage","agent","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":3,"created":"2026-04-04T13:35:48.000Z","updated":"2026-08-12T08:02:23.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://ajaybandiwaddar01-queue-doctor.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ajaybandiwaddar01/queue-doctor","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T17:24:48.352Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T17:24:48.352Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T17:24:48.352Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🏥","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A genuine multi-step reinforcement learning environment for emergency department triage. Built for the Meta PyTorch OpenEnv Hackathon.","Queue Doctor places an AI agent in charge of a hospital emergency department. At every step, the agent observes the queue of waiting patients and decides who to treat next. The environment state changes meaningfully after every decision — new patients arrive on a fixed schedule, wait times accumulate, patient conditions deteriorate — making this a true Markov Decision Process.","A better policy produces measurably better outcomes. The LLM agent scores 0.81 on Task 1 under triage uncertainty, 0.61 on Task 2 under resource pressure, and 0.29 on Task 3 under mass casualty conditions. That difficulty gradient is exactly what RL training is designed to exploit."],"features":["Serving Patient A now means Patient B's wait time increases by 1 step, reducing the reward available for serving them later","Ignoring a deteriorating patient means their severity worsens at step N+3, making the queue harder to manage going forward","Conserving the single ICU bed in steps 1–11 (Task 3) is the only way to survive the mass casualty surge at step 12"],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ajaybandiwaddar01/queue-doctor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"00a863a2089c7450b4906e9c05922d39bd41214084776aa5fecd18fc8557387f","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T17:24:48.433Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T17:24:48.433Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A genuine multi-step reinforcement learning environment for emergency department triage. Built for the Meta PyTorch OpenEnv Hackathon.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ajaybandiwaddar01/queue-doctor/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"A genuine multi-step reinforcement learning environment for emergency department triage. Built for the Meta PyTorch OpenEnv Hackathon.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ajaybandiwaddar01/queue-doctor/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"00a863a2089c7450b4906e9c05922d39bd41214084776aa5fecd18fc8557387f","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ajaybandiwaddar01/queue-doctor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T17:24:48.433Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-12T08:02:23.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ajaybandiwaddar01/queue-doctor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T17:24:48.433Z","hash":"00a863a2089c7450b4906e9c05922d39bd41214084776aa5fecd18fc8557387f","originalBytes":11626,"storedBytes":11626,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["patient","queue","step","severity","patients","task","triage","agent","state","icu","emergency","get","score","steps","doctors","environment","wait","across","episode","grader","true","bed","fairness","resource","reward","urgent","url","api","available","casualty","mass","scores","seed","serve","time","tool","under","action","arrive","baseline","docker","doctor","env.call","every","export","false","means","must","name","p001","red","returns","serving","specialist","tasks","waves","when","base","bash","beds","